31,2,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Yumi,,It turns out people in the outer wards really loved the outreach! But some old programs just stopped.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems some digital efforts from years ago were left unfinished, while community-led groups survived.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"We have retired tradespeople, but no one on staff is actually trained to supervise outside facilitators.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The grants only cover the first year. After that, the operating budget has to pick up the slack.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The bus links are gone in two wards. People have to travel an hour now.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, that's terrible! We have to do something to reach them if they can't get here.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, your point about supervision is critical. We cannot implement a technical service without oversight.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,Exactly. And the person who certified the power tools is gone. A workshop would be a liability.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"Also, the vehicle lines overran last year. A mobile service might be expensive to maintain.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,But the road closures didn't stop the community halls... maybe we can use those?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"If the community groups survived on their own, maybe we should support something like that?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The data shows remote catalogue use peaks late at night. Our physical hours are a bottleneck.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,A digital portal wouldn't require physical supervision or tool certification. It's safer.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,But the grant terms mean we need a plan for year two. A portal has lower recurring costs than a van.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I still feel the mobile service is the only way to help those without buses.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"I agree with Daisuke, but we have to make sure it doesn't just disappear after a year.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Logic suggests the Digital Archive is the most sustainable, given the past failures of digitisation.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,I agree. It avoids the staffing gap and the liability of the workshop.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Minako,,"I am leaning toward the portal or the language circles, provided the funding is stable.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just don't want the outer wards to be forgotten again.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,,status,Minako,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
56,3,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
